index d67381b..72d7129 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -5,6 +5,10 @@ Version 3.1.0
 
 Unreleased
 
+-   Add ``case_sensitive`` parameter to ``groupby`` filter. By default, string keys
+    differing only by lowercasing belong to one group, retaining the spelling of the
+    first encountered key and the input order of its members. Use ``case_sensitive=True``
+    to keep differently cased keys separate. :issue:`XXX`
 -   Drop support for Python 3.6. :pr:`1534`
 -   Remove previously deprecated code. :pr:`1544`
 
